[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4382.95, "timestamp": "01:13:02", "text": "面具。我打算在我的……上放一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4387.59, "timestamp": "01:13:07", "text": "我和一位街头模特合作了。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4389.99, "timestamp": "01:13:09", "text": "我表弟会和我一起做，但他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4397.83, "timestamp": "01:13:17", "text": "我记得我买过……呃，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4402.31, "timestamp": "01:13:22", "text": "日本的pa maserite或其他什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4405.91, "timestamp": "01:13:25", "text": "从亚马逊购买，感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4408.95, "timestamp": "01:13:28", "text": "有点贵，但我买的时候大概花了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4413.03, "timestamp": "01:13:33", "text": "我当时就想，对啊，时尚，我就这么做吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4415.669, "timestamp": "01:13:35", "text": "然后，接下来的事情就发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4418.79, "timestamp": "01:13:38", "text": "co 发生的时候就是发生的时候，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4421.189, "timestamp": "01:13:41", "text": "便宜得多，但我感觉自己像个傻瓜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4424.31, "timestamp": "01:13:44", "text": "我为什么花了那么多钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4427.03, "timestamp": "01:13:47", "text": "感觉好像贵一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4431.11, "timestamp": "01:13:51", "text": "一款简单的口罩。是的，确实如此。"}]